  "name": {
    "zh": "全线通车",
    "en": "The Whole Line Opens"
  },
  "story": {
    "zh": "通车典礼这天，整条铁路要从始发站一路开到终点站：先过大桥跨过西边的河，再钻隧道穿过山脉，最后还要分出一条支线通往货场。浅色的湖面和山地都只许铁路占用。",
    "en": "On opening day the whole line runs from the origin station to the terminal: over the bridge across the western river, through the tunnel under the ridge, with a spur branching off to the freight yard. Light lake and mountain cells may only be taken by railway track."
  },
